{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "let me show you the Dubai map, the way I see it, not as a list of areas, but as a money map.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000001"}], "text": "The speaker claims to present a different view of the Dubai map as a 'money map' rather than just a list of areas, implying an alternate strategy for investment."}, "title": "Dubai Investment Map", "topic": "Dubai Investment Strategy"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:knowledge:8422387e45076e3f", "metadata_hash": "eae5b9cb4b9121934c12481c70287ac65df6b782b86ce6ae49e30421bb46e963", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Dubai Investment Map", "topic": "Dubai Investment Strategy", "topic_slug": "dubai-investment-strategy"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Dubai doesn't work like that.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000002"}], "text": "Dubai's growth model is described as 'more palace-centric,' creating new centers with government plans, unlike the 'moneycentric' model seen in other capitals like London or Paris."}, "title": "Dubai Growth Model", "topic": "Dubai Growth"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:knowledge:7a12a8a72d01c971", "metadata_hash": "eae5b9cb4b9121934c12481c70287ac65df6b782b86ce6ae49e30421bb46e963", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Dubai Growth Model", "topic": "Dubai Growth", "topic_slug": "dubai-growth"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000007"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "One of the simplest ways to start understanding Dubai, past, current, and future demand is through its main roads.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000007"}], "text": "Understanding Dubai's past, current, and future demand can start by analyzing its main roads."}, "title": "Impact of Roads on Demand", "topic": "Dubai Demand"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:knowledge:222ff51436d62f02", "metadata_hash": "eae5b9cb4b9121934c12481c70287ac65df6b782b86ce6ae49e30421bb46e963", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Impact of Roads on Demand", "topic": "Dubai Demand", "topic_slug": "dubai-demand"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000009"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "you don't have to have a knowledge about these areas because this is only for GCC passport holders and there is not much you can buy here.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000009"}], "text": "The old center of Dubai like Deira and Karama have constraints for non-GCC passport holders, limiting purchasing options."}, "title": "Old Centers and GCC Holders", "topic": "Dubai Investment Constraints"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:knowledge:a2ae335543043367", "metadata_hash": "eae5b9cb4b9121934c12481c70287ac65df6b782b86ce6ae49e30421bb46e963", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Old Centers and GCC Holders", "topic": "Dubai Investment Constraints", "topic_slug": "dubai-investment-constraints"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000020"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "if you are looking for hustle-free long-term tenant, prices in Dubai Marina will be probably lower.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000020"}], "text": "Dubai Marina's expected high demand for short-term rentals contrasts with lower prices for long-term tenants."}, "title": "Investment in Dubai Marina", "topic": "Dubai Investment Strategy"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:knowledge:b1c8853dd86e1a04", "metadata_hash": "eae5b9cb4b9121934c12481c70287ac65df6b782b86ce6ae49e30421bb46e963", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Investment in Dubai Marina", "topic": "Dubai Investment Strategy", "topic_slug": "dubai-investment-strategy"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000023"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "clients bought a unit there in 2019 for two bedroom for 3.6 million dirhams. And ... the price was 7.2.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000023"}], "text": "A client bought a two-bedroom unit on a post-handover payment plan in 2019 and its price increased from 3.6 million dirhams to 7.2 million dirhams by November 2025."}, "title": "Boulevard Island Investment", "topic": "Dubai Investment Strategy"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:knowledge:2ee7f317bafe7858", "metadata_hash": "eae5b9cb4b9121934c12481c70287ac65df6b782b86ce6ae49e30421bb46e963", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Boulevard Island Investment", "topic": "Dubai Investment Strategy", "topic_slug": "dubai-investment-strategy"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000026"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "I want to specifically stop myself on this area Marjan. uh You probably heard of this new upcoming developments.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000026"}], "text": "New developments in Marjan are catching the interest of major developers despite current lack of direct road connectivity."}, "title": "Marjan Development", "topic": "Dubai Development"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:knowledge:bc3d394c7f1e88f9", "metadata_hash": "eae5b9cb4b9121934c12481c70287ac65df6b782b86ce6ae49e30421bb46e963", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Marjan Development", "topic": "Dubai Development", "topic_slug": "dubai-development"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000004", "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000005", "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000006", "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000007"], "cue": {"citations": [{"quote": "they can cash out with profit even during construction. And by the time they came to me, the unit was listed for several months with zero offers.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000006"}], "text": "The speaker describes Apple's property as being in a good location on paper but with issues preventing sale."}, "diagnosis": {"citations": [{"quote": "the developer is new, is actually the first residential project for him... the delay looked like at least one year.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000006"}], "text": "The issue was attributed to the developer's inexperience and construction delays."}, "kind": "reported_exchange", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Apple came to me for a consultation around nine months ago. They had a portfolio of three units in Dubai.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000004"}], "text": "A consultation with Apple regarding their property portfolio in Dubai's Marina area."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": {"citations": [{"quote": "One of the simplest ways to start understanding Dubai, past, current, and future demand is through its main roads.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000007"}], "text": "Understanding demand through its main roads is a more effective strategy for investment in Dubai."}, "title": "Dubai Marina Investment Issue", "topic": "Dubai Investment Strategy"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:cases:ac53697893f35d31", "metadata_hash": "eae5b9cb4b9121934c12481c70287ac65df6b782b86ce6ae49e30421bb46e963", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Dubai Marina Investment Issue", "topic": "Dubai Investment Strategy", "topic_slug": "dubai-investment-strategy"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000002", "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000003"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "the city usually grows from the old center, historical core,", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000002"}, {"quote": "Dubai doesn't work like that. It's not one center with everything growing around it.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000002"}], "text": "The speaker contrasts Dubai's growth with other world capitals using a sequence describing first what typically happens, then explaining how Dubai diverges from this pattern."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Dubai Growth Explanation", "topic": "Dubai Growth"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:expression:7b22cd3fc6415403", "metadata_hash": "eae5b9cb4b9121934c12481c70287ac65df6b782b86ce6ae49e30421bb46e963", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Dubai Growth Explanation", "topic": "Dubai Growth", "topic_slug": "dubai-growth"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000019"], "form": "tone", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "if you invest into this tower, of course, you have to buy a ready unit. You will have of only rental income. The price appreciation will be completely minimal.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000019"}], "text": "The speaker uses a candid tone to discuss the realities of investing in older buildings within Dubai Marina."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Real Estate Strategy Description", "topic": "Dubai Investment Strategy"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:expression:b4e44b9e25ccdb12", "metadata_hash": "eae5b9cb4b9121934c12481c70287ac65df6b782b86ce6ae49e30421bb46e963", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Real Estate Strategy Description", "topic": "Dubai Investment Strategy", "topic_slug": "dubai-investment-strategy"}
