{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000045", "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000046"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "Do you actually read the buyer map as an investor?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000045"}], "text": "To make informed investment decisions in real estate."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "Who is the tenant, buyer, or end user for this property?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000045"}], "text": "Identify who is the tenant, buyer, or end user for the property."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Why would they choose this location, not somewhere else?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000045"}], "text": "Determine why they would choose this location."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "What is the demand engine for the next five to ten years?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000045"}], "text": "Consider what the demand engine for the next five to ten years is."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "What can push the price up, and what can slow down your exit?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000045"}], "text": "Assess what can push the price up and what can slow down the exit."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "What happens if the project gets delayed.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000045"}], "text": "Contemplate what happens if the project gets delayed."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Before you buy, ask the six questions.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000045"}], "text": "There are six questions to consider before buying a property: Who is the tenant, buyer, or end user? Why would they choose this location? What is the demand engine for the next five to ten years? What can push the price up, and what can slow down the exit? What happens if the project gets delayed?"}, "title": "Factors affecting real estate buying decisions", "topic": "Investment strategy"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:knowledge:06f627a84aae6b6c", "metadata_hash": "eae5b9cb4b9121934c12481c70287ac65df6b782b86ce6ae49e30421bb46e963", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Factors affecting real estate buying decisions", "topic": "Investment strategy", "topic_slug": "investment-strategy"}
